  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"DepreciationEntries\">Depreciation Entries</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Assets Depreciation DepreciationEntries Fixed_asset FixedAsset FixedAssets On To ToDate User Users\">The <strong>Depreciation Entries</strong> tab enables users to monitor the decrease in value of the company's fixed assets throughout their anticipated lifespan.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none ltr:pr-8 rtl:pl-8\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 ltr:pl-8 rtl:pr-8\"><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"border-y ltr:border-l rtl:border-r border-neutral-300 bg-white p-4 flex gap-2 items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-sort-size-down text-neutral-400\"></i><span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"DepreciationEntries\">Depreciation Entries</span></span></div><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Create Depreciation DepreciationEntry NewDepreciationEntry On To ToDate\">To create a new depreciation entry, click the <strong>New Depreciation Entry</strong> button.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"mt-4 ms-4 pe-8 items-center bg-neutral-100 p-4 border-neutral-200 border-s border-t rounded-ss-lg flex gap-4 shadow-[inset_0px_1px_0px_#fff]\"><span class=\"text-base font-bold text-neutral-300 [text-shadow:_1px_1px_0px_#fff]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"DepreciationEntries\">Depreciation Entries</span></span><span class=\"text-neutral-300 hover:text-neutral-400\"><i class=\"fas fa-square-question\" style=\"font-size: 16px\"></i></span><span class=\"bg-white text-neutral-700 border border-neutral-300 font-semibold rounded-md py-2 px-4 text-sm\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NewDepreciationEntry\">New Depreciation Entry</span></span></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Column Columns 